{"unit_id":"Arfrsa__dsh-sidebar-sections#card-zh","repo":"Arfrsa/dsh-sidebar-sections","commit":"f9df5631d4b963e0a8c9c58308fa74c858eb86b1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-sections（DSH 插件，Web 侧边栏）：把工作区列表整理为活跃、会话任务和不活跃三个区域，并保留官方列表已有的搜索、菜单和拖放能力。它替换内置工作区列表的加载行，在原浏览器界面上增加按活动时间自动归类、手动固定区域、调整活跃天数阈值和折叠分组等能力。会话任务区域对应一个固定工作区；用户也可一键切回原生列表视图。适合需要按最近活动整理大量工作区的 DSH Web 用户。会话任务区依赖 Windows 路径 D:\\files\\history-tasks；不需要 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-9","lib/client.js:1128-1189","lib/index.js:16-28"]}
{"unit_id":"Arfrsa__dsh-sidebar-sections#card-en","repo":"Arfrsa/dsh-sidebar-sections","commit":"f9df5631d4b963e0a8c9c58308fa74c858eb86b1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-sections groups DSH web workspaces into Active, Session tasks, and Inactive sections. It adds activity based grouping, manual pins, an adjustable threshold, and a switch to the native list. Session tasks uses D:\\files\\history-tasks. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-9","lib/client.js:1128-1189","lib/index.js:16-28"]}
