{"unit_id":"Arfrsa__dsh-sidebar-sections#feature-1","repo":"Arfrsa/dsh-sidebar-sections","commit":"f9df5631d4b963e0a8c9c58308fa74c858eb86b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-sections 的功能「activity」：按最近活动把工作区分到活跃或不活跃区，当前会话及待处理状态优先视为活跃。。通过侧边栏选项或工作区行菜单使用，结果为按设置整理的工作区列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1134-1183"]}
{"unit_id":"Arfrsa__dsh-sidebar-sections#feature-2","repo":"Arfrsa/dsh-sidebar-sections","commit":"f9df5631d4b963e0a8c9c58308fa74c858eb86b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-sections 的功能「pins」：可从工作区行菜单手动固定到活跃或不活跃区，固定选择优先于自动阈值。。通过侧边栏选项或工作区行菜单使用，结果为按设置整理的工作区列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1159-1168"]}
{"unit_id":"Arfrsa__dsh-sidebar-sections#feature-3","repo":"Arfrsa/dsh-sidebar-sections","commit":"f9df5631d4b963e0a8c9c58308fa74c858eb86b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-sections 的功能「threshold」：可在视图选项调整或重置活跃天数阈值，默认 7 天。。通过侧边栏选项或工作区行菜单使用，结果为按设置整理的工作区列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1034-1047"]}
{"unit_id":"Arfrsa__dsh-sidebar-sections#feature-4","repo":"Arfrsa/dsh-sidebar-sections","commit":"f9df5631d4b963e0a8c9c58308fa74c858eb86b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-sections 的功能「history」：提供固定会话任务工作区，并在分段视图中平铺展开。。通过侧边栏选项或工作区行菜单使用，结果为按设置整理的工作区列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-28"]}
{"unit_id":"Arfrsa__dsh-sidebar-sections#feature-5","repo":"Arfrsa/dsh-sidebar-sections","commit":"f9df5631d4b963e0a8c9c58308fa74c858eb86b1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-sections 的功能「native」：可从视图选项切回原生工作区列表。。通过侧边栏选项或工作区行菜单使用，结果为按设置整理的工作区列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1144-1158"]}
{"unit_id":"Arfrsa__dsh-sidebar-sections#caveat-1","repo":"Arfrsa/dsh-sidebar-sections","commit":"f9df5631d4b963e0a8c9c58308fa74c858eb86b1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-sections 使用固定 Windows 工作区路径 D:\\files\\history-tasks；宿主启动时尝试创建该目录，分段界面将其作为会话任务区。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-28","package.json:22-46"]}
{"unit_id":"Arfrsa__dsh-sidebar-sections#caveat-2","repo":"Arfrsa/dsh-sidebar-sections","commit":"f9df5631d4b963e0a8c9c58308fa74c858eb86b1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"该插件声明兼容 DSH >=0.2.1-rc.3 且 <0.3.0，并将 Web 客户端标为目标平台。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-28","package.json:22-46"]}
